OL,3,GNEWSAKarate boosts social skills, say
OL,4,Ayoung champions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young karate champion who previously
OL,7,Fstruggled with anxiety says the sport
OL,8,Fhas given him a confidence boost.
OL,10,FArena Karate in Hadleigh, Suffolk,
OL,11,Fbrought home 18 medals after
OL,12,Frepresenting Great Britain at the WTKA
OL,13,FUnified World Championships in Carrara,
OL,14,FItaly.
OL,16,FAmong the competitors was Oliver, 11,
OL,17,Fwho lives in Essex, said the sport had
OL,18,Fmade it much easier for him to talk to
OL,19,Fpeople he had not met before.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
