OL,3,GNEWSAKarate boosts social skills, say
OL,4,Ayoung champions
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I feel like karate has helped me
OL,7,Fimprove my social skills. When you have
OL,8,Fsports, you've got peers around you;
OL,9,Fit's a bit extraordinary having people
OL,10,Fdoing the same thing as you," he said.
